  {
    "id": "fuse-nudge",
    "on": {
      "type": "use",
      "target": "fuse-coil"
    },
    "if": [
      {
        "notFlag": "powder-placed"
      }
    ],
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You have a fuse and, as yet, nothing that wants one. The keg's label suggests the correct order of operations."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "place-powder",
    "on": {
      "type": "use",
      "target": "powder-keg"
    },
    "once": true,
    "if": [
      {
        "atLocation": "breach-wall"
      }
    ],
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You seat the keg into the seam at the wall's foot, snug as a stone in an arch. It fits like the wall was measured for it — which, considering who did the measuring, is not a comforting thought."
      },
      {
        "kind": "setFlag",
        "flag": "powder-placed"
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "powder-keg",
        "to": "nowhere"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "attach-fuse",
    "on": {
      "type": "use",
      "target": "fuse-coil"
    },
    "once": true,
    "if": [
      {
        "flag": "powder-placed",
        "atLocation": "breach-wall"
      }
    ],
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You crimp the fuse to the charge and pay the coil out along the floor, west, into the maze's first turning. A walking pace of fire, and then the argument. All it wants now is a light."
      },
      {
        "kind": "setFlag",
        "flag": "fused"
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "fuse-coil",
        "to": "breach-wall"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "detonate",
    "on": {
      "type": "use",
      "target": "fuse-coil"
    },
    "once": true,
    "if": [
      {
        "flag": "fused"
      }
    ],
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "The fuse takes the flame and walks off into the dark with it, unhurried, keeping its appointment. You go west at a pace you would not call unhurried at all. The mountain says one word. The draught becomes a wind, and then a door."
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "fuse-coil",
        "to": "nowhere"
      },
      {
        "kind": "teleport",
        "to": "twisty-5"
      },
      {
        "kind": "setFlag",
        "flag": "breach-blasted"
      },
      {
        "kind": "revealExit",
        "location": "breach-wall",
        "dir": "e"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "mechanism-fit",
    "on": {
      "type": "use",
      "target": "mechanism"
    },
    "once": true,
    "if": [
      {
        "hasItem": "bronze-tool"
      }
    ],
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "The bronze tool bridges the wrongness exactly. The slots take it, the collar turns, and the weight of the far wall goes somewhere else with a sound like a held breath ending. It was not made for your hand. Your hand makes do."
      },
      {
        "kind": "setFlag",
        "flag": "mechanism-turned"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "take-the-kept",
    "on": {
      "type": "take",
      "target": "the-kept"
    },
    "once": true,
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You lift it. It has its weight, and nothing else. Whatever it did, whatever it does, it keeps to itself — a fact with mass. The room is just a room now, and you are a person holding a thing, a long way down, with a long way back."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "canary-sings-warm-gallery",
    "on": {
      "type": "enter",
      "target": "warm-gallery"
    },
    "if": [
      {
        "hasItem": "canary-cage"
      }
    ],
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "The canary, which has kept a professional silence the whole way down, begins to sing. Full-throated, unafraid, at home. Nothing about that is reassuring."
      }
    ]
  },
