  {
    "id": "search-bench",
    "on": {
      "type": "search",
      "target": "assay-bench"
    },
    "once": true,
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You run a hand along the seam where the bench meets the wall and come up with somebody's rounding error: a bead of assay gold, rolled out of reach and written off a lifetime ago."
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "assay-button",
        "to": "assay-office"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "search-foreman",
    "on": {
      "type": "search",
      "target": "foreman"
    },
    "once": true,
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You go through his pockets with more apology than efficiency. His watch, stopped. His tally book, the pencil still in its loop. You are the first person in ninety years to ask him for anything."
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "foremans-watch",
        "to": "broken-drift"
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "tally-book",
        "to": "broken-drift"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "search-foremans-desk",
    "on": {
      "type": "search",
      "target": "foremans-desk"
    },
    "once": true,
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "The drawer sticks, then gives. Pushed to the back, behind requisition forms for timber that never came: a small iron key, tagged MAGAZINE in the clerk's careful hand."
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "key-magazine",
        "to": "foremans-office"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "search-stacks",
    "on": {
      "type": "search",
      "target": "stacks"
    },
    "once": true,
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "You work along the cradles, plate after plate, all counts and no unit — until near the bottom you find the one that is different: a later hand, newer marks, the final rows still open, as though the counting were not considered finished. You take that thought and put it somewhere you keep such things."
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "tally-plate",
        "to": "tally-chamber"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "pull-stull",
    "on": {
      "type": "use",
      "target": "stull"
    },
    "once": true,
    "do": [
      {
        "kind": "print",
        "text": "The stull comes free with less argument than you expected, which is the worst sign there is. Overhead, the roof clears its throat. Behind where the timber stood, the garnet seam sits open-handed. You would put it at about six good breaths before the mountain finishes the sentence."
      },
      {
        "kind": "moveItem",
        "item": "cut-garnets",
        "to": "stull-gallery"
      },
      {
        "kind": "startTimer",
        "timer": "roof-fall",
        "turns": 6
      }
    ]
  },
